    <sys:String x:Key="ImportaDialogoTitolo">Create a New Text</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ImportaDialogoAiuto">Type the information on the text. The Title is required, the Abbreviation will be created automatically if you do not give it, the other value are optional. If you hover the mouse over the boxes, more information is given.</sys:String>
